Great vista.  Taking a morning walk on the cold windswept dunes.  Having all the subjects in the far distance really works here (and sometimes it does not).  The figure and the building/towers nicely balance each other.</td>', 'Great vista.  Taking a morning walk on the cold windswept dunes.  Having all the subjects in the far distance really works here (and sometimes it does not).  The figure and the building/towers nicely balance each other.', '2025-05-25 13:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7781803, 1294749, 91496, '<td valign="top">
Well done.  The top down drone shot.  So easy to do, yet so hard to find a really impactful composition.  This really works with the rows of cars. white lines, and tree all complimenting each other.  As a nit, perhaps clone out the rightmost arrow which points/takes you out of the frame.  Or under extended rules flip it to curve back into the image.  :)</td>', 'Well done.  The top down drone shot.  So easy to do, yet so hard to find a really impactful composition.  This really works with the rows of cars. white lines, and tree all complimenting each other.  As a nit, perhaps clone out the rightmost arrow which points/takes you out of the frame.  Or under extended rules flip it to curve back into the image.  :)', '2025-05-25 13:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7781804, 1294825, 91496, '<td valign="top">
